| `dependency_audit.timeout_seconds` | integer | `120` | a whole number from 1 to `threading.TIMEOUT_MAX` | `scripts/audit_dependencies.py`, through `scripts/config_loader.py`'s `dependency_audit.timeout_seconds` row | Sets how many seconds one app's `npm audit --json` may run; past it `make fe-audit` ends it and exits 11. Absent, the audit writes `[using default] dependency_audit.timeout_seconds = 120` to stderr. | a saved report: `--report` runs no npm | always |
